          "question": {
            "text": "Diborane $\\left(\\mathrm{B}_{2} \\mathrm{H}_{6}\\right)$ reacts independently with $\\mathrm{O}_{2}$ and $\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}$ to produce, respectively:",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
