          ],
          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 2,
          "question": {
            "text": "Among the following substituted silanes, the one which will give rise to cross linked silicone polymer on hydrolysis is?",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "wid25",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Si</mi></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "ZG2ql",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>SiCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "QCLmA",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>SiCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4dGW2",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>SiCl</mi></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "<p>Among the following substituted silanes, the one which will give rise to cross-linked silicone polymer on hydrolysis is&nbsp;trichloroalkylsilane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>RSiCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>RSCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> gives cross-linked silicon polymer on hydrolysis.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/3339b557-90b1-403d-af07-adf5f3a28ca7-image.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 315px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
            "image": null
